# CORRECTNESS-E2E-01 GROUPING (W4-F03): the antiderivative of sin(x^2) has complex factors
# sqrt(2)/2*(1-i); the screen dropped their grouping (sqrt(2)*1 - i*x ...).
# assert_calculus_result_exact pins Giac's text; dump_calculus emits the displayed tree that
# out/correctness-e2e-01/phase4/GROUPING/check_display.sh evaluates. Structure is asserted by
# the host regression. No golden, no CI wiring.
wait 200
open_app Calculus
wait 60
key ac
key ac
key f2
set_angle_mode rad
key sin
key x
key ^
key 2
key right
key right
key enter
wait 5
assert_calculus_status ok
assert_calculus_result_exact sqrt(pi)/(sqrt(2)/2*(1-i))/2*erf(sqrt(2)/2*(1-i)*x)/(2*i)+i*sqrt(pi)/(sqrt(2)/2*(1+i))/2*erf(sqrt(2)/2*(1+i)*x)/2
dump_calculus G|int_sinx2_rad
